  "worked_solution": "Multiplying each row in the first matrix by each column in the second, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3\\cdot (-3)+(-2)\\cdot 5 & 3\\cdot 2+(-2)\\cdot (-1) \\\\ (-1)\\cdot (-3)+4\\cdot 5 & (-1)\\cdot 2+4\\cdot (-1)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-9+(-10) & 6+2 \\\\ 3+20 & -2+(-4)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-19 & 8 \\\\ 23 & -6\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
